{"speciesId":332,"names":{"fr":"Cacturne","es":"Cacturne","en":"Cacturne","ja":"ノクタス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"During the daytime, CACTURNE remains unmoving so that it does not lose any moisture to the harsh desert sun. This POKéMON becomes active at night when the temperature drops."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If a traveler is going through a desert in the thick of night, CACTURNE will follow in a ragtag group. The POKéMON are biding their time, waiting for the traveler to tire and become incapable of moving."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"After spending thousands of years in harsh deserts, its blood transformed into the same substances as sand. It is nocturnal, so it hunts at night."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives in deserts. It becomes active at night when it hunts for prey exhausted from the desert’s heat."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lives in deserts. It becomes active at night when it hunts for prey exhausted from the desert’s heat."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il sort la nuit pour chasser. Il traque les proies épuisées après une journée dans le désert."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il sort la nuit pour chasser. Il traque les proies épuisées après une journée dans le désert."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il sort la nuit pour chasser. Il traque les proies épuisées après une journée dans le désert."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es un Pokémon nocturno. Busca presas agotadas por el calor diurno del desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"夜になると 活動を はじめる。 砂漠の 暑さに 疲れ果てた 獲物を 見つけ出し 捕らえるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les Cacturne traquent en groupe les voyageurs du désert, guettant les signes de fatigue pour frapper."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Persiguen en grupo a los viajeros del desierto y los acechan hasta que el cansancio los agote."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"砂漠の 旅人の 後ろを 集団で つきまとい 疲れて 動けなく なるのを 待つのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pendant la journée, Cacturne reste immobile pour éviter de se déshydrater sous le soleil du désert. Ce Pokémon ne commence son activité qu’une fois la nuit tombée, sous une température plus fraîche."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Durante el día, Cacturne permanece inmóvil para no perder nada de humedad bajo el sol de justicia del desierto. Este Pokémon entra en acción por la noche, cuando bajan las temperaturas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"During the daytime, Cacturne remains unmoving so that it does not lose any moisture to the harsh desert sun. This Pokémon becomes active at night when the temperature drops."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"砂漠の 日差しで 水分を 失わない ように 昼間は じっと 立ち尽くしている。 気温の 下がる 夜に 活動を 始める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsqu’un voyageur traverse le désert au milieu de la nuit, les Cacturne le suivent en groupe. Ces Pokémon attendent le bon moment, quand le voyageur est fatigué et qu’il n’est plus capable de bouger."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando alguien se adentra en un desierto por la noche, Cacturne le sigue junto con varios de los suyos. Este Pokémon espera pacientemente a que el viajero se fatigue y no pueda continuar más, vencido por el cansancio."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If a traveler is going through a desert in the thick of night, Cacturne will follow in a ragtag group. The Pokémon are biding their time, waiting for the traveler to tire and become incapable of moving."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"真夜中 砂漠を 歩く 旅人の 後ろを ぞろぞろと 集団で くっついて 歩く。 疲れて 動けなく なるのを 待っているのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":332,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns"